          "prst": null,
          "flipH": null,
          "flipV": null,
          "text": "Left-brain science brings us disembodied, decontextualized facts about the worldArt and myth are centered in the right-brain and are focused on how embodied humans should act in the real world, which is particular and uncertainBoth left and right-brained thinking is necessary for a world-class scientific enterpriseThe scientist is servant to the humanities majorThey control how our inventions are usedThe Saint Luke Guild helps develop right-brain thinking by bringing high quality reproductions of the greatest works of art in the Western Canon to average studentsDeveloping an appreciation for rapt attention alongside clinical attentionOver 10 years projects of a similar scale could be done in every school throughout the country for ~.086% of their budget ($50k*130,980 schools/$762 billion/10 years)Compare with Zuckerberg\u2019s $100,000,000 donation to the Newark School District \u2013 Zero improvement in student achievementFixing education is an extraordinarily difficult problem \u2013 No one solution will doWe need to reinvigorate the imagination and motivation of students \u2013 The problem more of a soul problem than a money problem",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "text": "Left-brain science brings us disembodied, decontextualized facts about the world",
              "level": 0,
              "sz": 2400,
              "bold": null
            },
            {
              "text": "Art and myth are centered in the right-brain and are focused on how embodied humans should act in the real world, which is particular and uncertain",
              "level": 0,
              "sz": 2400,
              "bold": null
            },
            {
              "text": "Both left and right-brained thinking is necessary for a world-class scientific enterprise",
              "level": 0,
              "sz": 2400,
              "bold": null
            },
            {
              "text": "The scientist is servant to the humanities major",
              "level": 0,
              "sz": 2400,
              "bold": null
            },
            {
              "text": "They control how our inventions are used",
              "level": 1,
              "sz": 2000,
              "bold": null
            },
            {
              "text": "The Saint Luke Guild helps develop right-brain thinking by bringing high quality reproductions of the greatest works of art in the Western Canon to average students",
              "level": 0,
              "sz": 2400,
              "bold": null
            },
            {
              "text": "Developing an appreciation for rapt attention alongside clinical attention",
              "level": 1,
              "sz": 2000,
              "bold": null
            },
            {
              "text": "Over 10 years projects of a similar scale could be done in every school throughout the country for ~.086% of their budget ($50k*130,980 schools/$762 billion/10 years)",
              "level": 0,
              "sz": null,
              "bold": null
            },
            {
              "text": "Compare with Zuckerberg\u2019s $100,000,000 donation to the Newark School District \u2013 Zero improvement in student achievement",
              "level": 1,
              "sz": null,
              "bold": null
            },
            {
              "text": "Fixing education is an extraordinarily difficult problem \u2013 No one solution will do",
              "level": 1,
              "sz": null,
              "bold": null
            },
            {
              "text": "We need to reinvigorate the imagination and motivation of students \u2013 The problem more of a soul problem than a money problem",
              "level": 1,
              "sz": null,
              "bold": null
            }
